            "review_text": "Catherine L\nMorgan Hill, California40 contributions\n0\nConfetti Kafe in the Hanoi International Airport needs to upgrade their sanitary procedures and protocols\nMar 2025 • Couples\nOpen area with comfortable booths and a wide ranging menu. \n\nHave cappuccinos/ Latte pictured on menu however staff was not able to make a proper one. Was given what looks to be a coffee with some kind of milk. \n\n4 young staff were seen touching/fixing their hair, picking their face, touching/picking nose behind counter mirrors. Same staff are seen not wearing gloves and wiping down and touching utensils/silverware and placing on the tables. They also were serving customers their meals. One staff openly took off face mask and bent over and coughed loudly multiple times without covering their mouth. He continued to have terrible coughing fits. He did in the end put his mask on. We decided to change restaurants within the Int. Hanoi Airport. (Pre check area)\nRead more\nWritten March 20, 2025",
